- The code obtains a font (either by name or by default) and assigns font width and height to `vc->vc_font.width` and `vc->vc_font.height`.
- Then, it sets up the number of columns and rows by dividing the screen's width/height by `vc->vc_font.width`/`vc->vc_font.height`.

